{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27413","headline":"题永福寺临淮亭 · 顾非熊","name":"题永福寺临淮亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"淮上前朝寺，因公始建亭。\n虽无山可望，多有鹤堪听。\n引客闲垂钓，看僧静灌瓶。\n带潮秋见月，隔竹晓闻经。\n水气侵衣冷，苹风入座馨。\n路逢沙獭上，船值海人停。\n砧杵鸣孤戍，乌鸢下远汀。\n连波芳草阔，极目暮天青。\n创置嗟心匠，幽栖得地形。\n常来劝农事，赖此近郊垧。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"顾非熊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27413.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27413","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}